From 25de531868e71c3c4bcf6ad18df0714c9bbd723c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raphael port <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:04:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] sweet MTL: recycle freed GPU pool buffers within their owner
 (no map+bzero per full-screen render target)

---
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetAccelerator.cpp | 194 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 179 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetAccelerator.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetAccelerator.cpp
index 7787bd2..760403e 100644
